WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Sanké Mon — Collective Fishing Rite
San, Ségou Region, Mali

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:22.000
[Thousands gather at the sacred Sanké pond
on the second Thursday of the seventh lunar month]

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:35.000
[Communities of Malinké, Bambara, and Bobo
enter the water together in coordinated action]

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
[The rite commemorates the founding of the town
more than six centuries ago]

5
00:00:49.000 --> 00:01:00.000
[Sanké Mon marks the beginning of the rainy season —
blending ecology, spirituality, and celebration]

6
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:08.000
[UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage —
a tradition still practiced, still uniting a community]
